<p>There were a ton of people who critted and looked at this over its development, and I'm sure I've left people out. If I forgot you, just send me a message and I'll fix it.</p>
<p>Image Credits:</p>
<p>The picture of the Crab is released under CC-BY-2.0 and can be found here <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coconut_crab#/media/File:Birgus_latro.jpg">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coconut_crab#/media/File:Birgus_latro.jpg</a></p>
<p>The picture of the O'Neil Cylinder is a public domain image originally released by Nasa. <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/O%27Neill_cylinder#/media/File:Spacecolony3edit.jpeg">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/O%27Neill_cylinder#/media/File:Spacecolony3edit.jpeg</a></p>
<p>The cutaway diagram of the cylinders was manually made by me, and is released under CC-BY-3.0. I will provide the name of the program and a link to it once I remember it.</p>
